WEBVTT

00:00:05.608 --> 00:00:11.404
Choose Upload in the side menu.

00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:17.654
Click Choose videos.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.891
Choose a file from your computer.

00:00:28.141 --> 00:00:33.341
Wait until you see Uploaded just now.

00:00:33.591 --> 00:00:38.922
Click Edit details for demo_lesson.mp4.

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:45.172
Type "Learn how to save money on
mobile data." in the Description box.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:50.483
Tick Life Skills.

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:56.134
Select G from the Maturity rating list.

00:00:56.384 --> 00:01:00.234
Click Save changes.

00:01:00.484 --> 00:01:05.616
Wait until you see Changes saved.

00:01:05.866 --> 00:01:11.866
Check that Before you publish
shows what is left to do.

00:01:13.721 --> 00:01:17.580
Click Choose poster.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:23.830
Check that Save poster is on the screen.
